+ * way, with the layer, now hidden, given no drawable any more (Counter-
+ * Strike 2: one frame a second; MEASURED 2026-10-02).  A window-server
+ * ordering group (CGSAddWindowToWindowOrderingGroup) did not hold the
+ * overlay above the frame through those restacks, and took the frame off
+ * the screen with an overlay that was ordered out (MEASURED).
+ *
+ * So, while this application is the active one and no other X toplevel is
